    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Experience",
     "texto": [
      "**Experiență profesională** means \"professional experience\". **Am lucrat** (\"I have worked\") is used to mention a past period or experience."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Skills",
     "texto": [
      "**Competențe** are demonstrable abilities. In Romanian, **responsabilă** takes the feminine form when a woman speaks; **responsabil**, the masculine."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
